="8.469" end="8.814">I&apos;d</span> <span begin="8.814" end="9.138">fall</span> <span begin="9.138" end="9.555">right</span> <span begin="9.555" end="9.786">through</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从未想过会离开你</span></p><p begin="10.167" end="13.201" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.167" end="10.392">I</span> <span begin="10.392" end="10.861">fell</span> <span begin="11.136" end="11.332">for</span> <span begin="11.332" end="11.960">every</span> <span begin="11.960" end="12.368">word</span> <span begin="12.368" end="12.682">you</span> <span begin="12.682" end="13.201">said</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我对你说的每一个字坚信不疑</span></p><p begin="16.575" end="19.371" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.575" end="16.914">You</span> <span begin="16.914" end="17.307">made</span> <span begin="17.307" end="17.624">me</span> <span begin="17.624" end="18.092">feel</span> <span begin="18.092" end="18.491">I</span> <span begin="18.491" end="18.750">nee</span><span begin="18.750" end="19.179">ded</span> <span begin="19.179" end="19.371">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我感觉我需要你</span></p><p begin="19.731" end="22.602" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.731" end="20.036">And</span> <span begin="20.036" end="20.502">forced</span> <span begin="20.502" end="20.867">my</span> <span begin="20.867" end="21.282">heart</span> <span begin="21.282" end="21.656">to</span> <span begin="21.656" end="21.944">think</span> <span begin="21.944" end="22.211">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="22.211" end="22.602">true</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你强迫我相信这一切都是真的</span></p><p begin="22.774" end="25.938" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.774" end="22.875">But</span> <span begin="22.875" end="23.173">I</span> <span begin="23.173" end="23.689">found</span> <span begin="23.953" end="24.118">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="24.118" end="24.651">power</span><span begin="24.651" end="25.138">less</span> <span begin="25.138" end="25.462">with</span> <span begin="25.462" end="25.938">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但是我发现 和你在一起我是多么无力</span></p><p begin="28.586" end="33.697" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.586" end="28.853">Now</span> <span begin="28.853" end="29.828">I</span> <span begin="30.176" end="30.545">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="30.545" end="30.956">need</span> <span begin="30.956" end="31.280">your</span> <span begin="31.280" end="31.673">wings</span> <span begin="31.673" end="31.937">to</span> <span begin="31.937" end="32.298">fl</span><span begin="32.298" end="33.697">y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我不再需要你的翅膀去飞翔</span></p><p begin="34.735" end="40.709" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.735" end="35.321">No,</span> <span begin="35.321" end="36.017">I</span> <span begin="36.307" end="36.539">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="36.539" end="36.811">need</span> <span begin="36.811" end="37.001">a</span> <span begin="37.001" end="37.379">hand</span> <span begin="37.379" end="37.550">to</span> <span begin="37.550" end="37.949">hold</span> <span begin="37.949" end="38.246">in</span> <span begin="38.246" end="39.263">mine</span> <span begin="39.263" end="39.938">this</span> <span begin="39.938" end="40.709">time</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这次我不需要别人抓紧我的手</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="40.236" end="41.205"><span begin="40.236" end="40.677">(This</span> <span begin="40.677" end="41.205">time)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这次</span></span></p><p begin="41.562" end="44.445" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.562" end="41.727">You</span> <span begin="41.727" end="42.099">held</span> <span begin="42.099" end="42.297">me</span> <span begin="42.297" end="42.900">down,</span> <span begin="42.900" end="43.113">but</span> <span begin="43.113" end="43.443">I</span> <span begin="43.443" end="43.797">broke</span> <span begin="43.797" end="44.445">free</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你拖住我 但被我挣脱</span></p><p begin="44.715" end="47.413" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.715" end="44.859">I</span> <span begin="44.859" end="45.256">found</span> <span begin="45.256" end="45.563">the</span> <span begin="45.563" end="46.120">love</span> <span begin="46.120" end="46.352">in</span><span begin="46.352" end="46.708">side</span> <span begin="46.708" end="47.099">of</span> <span begin="47.099" end="47.413">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发现爱就在我心里</span></p><p begin="47.697" end="52.393" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.697" end="47.980">Now</span> <span begin="47.980" end="48.800">I</span> <span begin="49.105" end="49.315">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="49.315" end="49.687">need</span> <span begin="49.687" end="49.900">a</span> <span begin="49.900" end="50.170">hero</span> <span begin="50.170" end="50.608">to</span> <span begin="50.608" end="51.118">sur</span><span begin="51.118" end="52.129">vi</span><span begin="52.129" end="52.393">ve</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我不需要英雄也能生活</span></p><p begin="52.544" end="54.839" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.544" end="52.736">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="52.736" end="52.898">I</span> <span begin="52.898" end="53.096">al</span><span begin="53.096" end="53.440">ready</span> <span begin="53.440" end="53.810">saved</span> <span begin="53.810" end="54.272">my</span> <span begin="54.272" end="54.839">life</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我拯救了自己的生活</span></p><p begin="1:05.356" end="1:07.421" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.356" end="1:05.513">&apos;Cause</span> <span begin="1:05.513" end="1:05.684">I</span> <span begin="1:05.684" end="1:05.990">al</span><span begin="1:05.990" end="1:06.269">ready</span> <span begin="1:06.269" end="1:06.662">saved</span> <span begin="1:06.6